From: Code and Solder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: delegate UserPD lifecycle to child remoteproc

The root Q6 remoteproc already stages UserPD auxiliary firmware before
the root PAS transition and manages child UserPD PAS/SMEM startup/shutdown.
Do not stage the same IU again while root Q6 runs or duplicate PAS and SMP2P
state in WLAN.  Resolve a child rproc at probe but boot at HIF power_up,
preserving deferred radio startup and tracking one boot ref per device.

---
